-- **Gift for `B001`: an `object` that declares the entry.**
--
-- The SAME source as `eintritt.bau`, declared `object` instead of `program`. It is the one
-- question a single file cannot answer -- and a library that defines `main` collides with
-- the program that links it, at the linker, over two units.
compiler cc -std=c11 -O0 -Wall -Wextra -Werror
out      target/bau-eintritt-bib

unit bibliothek object
    messung/proben/probe-eintritt.gab
